   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102302 day=48 vid=gen_9h7h2i9 kind=guard-nothing pick="[goon] \"Keep going.\"" triggerPick="[agency:ask_field] \"What places have you found out there?\"" prevThem="\"an old trapline — remember the shape of it. It's real, and it's worth knowing.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102302 day=48 vid=gen_r9eo9x6 kind=guard-shut pick="[goon] \"Keep going.\"" triggerPick="[agency:ask_expedition] \"What did you see out there?\"" prevThem="\"Saw things with too many joints. Give them room. That's the whole lesson.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102302 day=52 vid=gen_9h7h2i9 kind=guard-shut pick="[goon] \"Keep going.\"" triggerPick="[agency:ask_field] \"What places have you found out there?\"" prevThem="\"a spring that runs clear — I'll mark it on your map when we're back. It's real, I've stood there.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102302 day=64 vid=gen_9h7h2i9 kind=guard-passes pick="[goon] \"And?\"" triggerPick="[teach] \"Here, I know this one — let me show you.\"" prevThem="You show them White Oak Acorns — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102302 day=71 vid=gen_r9eo9x6 kind=guard-shut pick="[goon] \"Wait, what? Go on —\"" triggerPick="[agency:ask_field] \"Teach me something from the wild.\"" prevThem="\"This one is Mugwort. Look at the leaf, feel the stem, breathe it in. It'll stick.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102303 day=71 vid=xavier_dubois kind=guard-passes pick="[goon] \"I'm here. Go on.\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_teach_me:a_tell] \"I'd rather show you while we're working. It's easier that way.\"" prevThem="\"All right. Show me when we work together. You'd know about that.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102303 day=79 vid=sam_wilson kind=guard-nod pick="[goon] \"I'm listening, I promise.\"" triggerPick="[agency:ask_field] \"Teach me something from the wild.\"" prevThem="\"African Wild Rice — crush the leaf, smell it, taste the stem. That's how you know it.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102303 day=99 vid=xavier_dubois kind=guard-sit pick="[goon] \"I'm listening, I promise.\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_name_day:a_count] \"I count. Someone has to.\"" prevThem="\"Good. Keep counting. The days need witnesses.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102304 day=64 vid=aroha_ngata kind=guard-hear pick="[goon] \"I'm listening, I promise.\"" triggerPick="[teach] \"Can I show you something? It might help.\"" prevThem="You show them Dandelion — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102304 day=79 vid=desmond_clarke kind=guard-nothing pick="[goon] \"Please, go on.\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_believe:a_tell] \"I believe we get through this. I have to. The alternative doesn't work.\"" prevThem="\"That's not naive. That's load-bearing. Hold onto it.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102306 day=34 vid=gen_471edaz kind=guard-passes pick="[goon] \"Take your time. I've got nowhere to be.\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_before_skill:a_tell] \"Patience. Sounds dumb. But waiting — really waiting, without fidgeting — that's a superpower now.\"" prevThem="\"Not dumb at all. The people who can't wait are the ones who make mistakes. You're an asset.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102308 day=16 vid=jorge_silva kind=guard-nod pick="[goon] \"Wait, what? Go on —\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_believe:a_tell] \"I believe we get through this. I have to. The alternative doesn't work.\"" prevThem="\"That's not naive. That's load-bearing. Hold onto it.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102308 day=45 vid=gen_03banya kind=guard-passes pick="[goon] \"Wait, what? Go on —\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_laugh_memory:a_tell] \"Recently — someone tripped over nothing and we all lost it. It felt like stealing.\"" prevThem="\"Stealing joy. I like that. We should steal more of it. I'm listening.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102308 day=84 vid=gen_03banya kind=guard-sit pick="[goon] \"I'm listening, I promise.\"" triggerPick="[teach] \"Here, I know this one — let me show you.\"" prevThem="You show them Groundnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=102308 day=85 vid=gen_hrd5tj2 kind=guard-hear pick="[goon] \"I'm listening, I promise.\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_fight:a_tell] \"Yes. I don't want to talk about the details. But yes.\"" prevThem="They nod, slow. \"Okay. Thank you for telling me. That couldn't have been easy to say.\""
